<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on Aug 18.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				   Aug 18		Aug 15</p>
<p>Fed acct			  4.621		 3.876</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   12.144		 6.214</p>
<p>Cash balance		   16.765		10.090</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	 5,310.293	   5,208.507</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $2 million were issued and $304 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
